{"awful":{"w":"awful","zh":["壞","糟糕","厲害","可怕","令人驚嘆的"],"ipa":{"uk":"/ˈɔːfʊl/","us":"/ˈɔːfʊl/"},"ety":[{"n":1,"chain":[{"l":"enm","f":"agheful","t":"inh"},{"l":"ine-pro","f":"*h₂egʰ-","t":"root"}],"text":"From Middle English agheful, awfull, auful, aȝefull, equivalent to awe + -ful. Compare Old English eġeful, eġefull (“terrifying; awful”). The “very bad” sense is a pejorative semantic shift from the original sense of “awe-inspiring”.","cog":[{"l":"ang","f":"eġeful"}]}],"pos":[{"p":"adj","e":0,"senses":[{"d":"Very bad.","ex":["The smell of my socks is awful.","We saw such an awful film last night that we left the theater before the end."],"grp":0,"zh":"壞；糟糕"},{"d":"Exceedingly great; usually applied intensively.","ex":["I have learnt an awful amount today.","“[…] I cook a lot. I make an awful lot of food. Jason thinks I must be cooking for an army sometimes,” she says, […]"],"grp":1},{"d":"Causing fear or horror; appalling, terrible.","tags":["dated"],"ex":["At our old pastimes in the hall\n⁠We gambol’d, making vain pretence\n⁠Of gladness, with an awful sense\nOf one mute Shadow watching all."],"grp":2,"zh":"厲害；可怕"},{"d":"Awe-inspiring; filling with profound reverence or respect; profoundly impressive.","tags":["archaic"],"ex":["As I am seen could I but gaze on Thee / Awful in majesty and royal might","God ought not to be commixed in our actions, but with awful reverence, and an attention full of honour and respect."],"syn":["awesome"],"grp":3,"zh":"令人驚嘆的"},{"d":"Struck or filled with awe or reverence.","tags":["archaic"],"grp":3,"zh":"令人驚嘆的"},{"d":"Terror-stricken.","tags":["obsolete"]},{"d":"Prone to a particular temptation.","tags":["Ireland"],"ex":["\"It's her imagination, that's what it is,\" Millie said. \"She's awful for imagining things, Wilfred agreed with me.\"","Tommy was just an awful man for the paper - couldn't get enough of the stuff! He'd have had the very Yellow Pages down him!"],"syn":["terrible"]}],"forms":[["comp","awfuller"],["comp","more awful"],["sup","awfullest"],["sup","most awful"]]},{"p":"adv","e":0,"senses":[{"d":"Awfully; dreadfully; terribly.","tags":["colloquial"],"ex":["The race was run, and the dog ran \"awful\"."]},{"d":"Very, extremely.","tags":["Canada","US","colloquial"],"ex":["That's an awful big house.","She seemed awful nice when I met her yesterday."],"grp":4,"zh":"很；非常"}]}],"grp":[{"label":"very bad","zh":["壞","糟糕"],"p":"adj","e":0,"tr":{"fr":["fr:affreux","fr:horrible","fr:immonde"],"it":["it:pessimo","it:terribile","it:orribile"],"es":["es:infumable","es:malísimo"],"pt":["pt:horrível","pt:terrível","pt:péssimo"]}},{"label":"exceedingly great","zh":[],"p":"adj","e":0,"tr":{"fr":[],"it":["it:impressionante"],"es":[],"pt":[]}},{"label":"causing fear; appalling; terrible","zh":["厲害","可怕"],"p":"adj","e":0,"tr":{"fr":["fr:terrible","fr:épouvantable","fr:horrible"],"it":["it:orribile"],"es":["es:espantoso"],"pt":["pt:horrível","pt:terrível","pt:medonho"]}},{"label":"inspiring awe","zh":["令人驚嘆的"],"p":"adj","e":0,"tr":{"fr":[],"it":[],"es":[],"pt":["pt:temível"]}},{"label":"colloquial: very, extremely","zh":["很","非常"],"p":"adv","e":0,"tr":{"fr":[],"it":["it:tremendamente","it:spaventosamente","it:terribilmente"],"es":[],"pt":[]}}],"lx":{"fr:affreux":{"w":"affreux","p":"adj","fem":"affreuse","ipa":"/a.fʁø/","gl":"frightful, causing fear","ety":{"chain":[],"text":"From affres (“great fear”) + -eux. See affres.","form":{"l":"fr","parts":["affres","-eux"]}}},"fr:horrible":{"w":"horrible","p":"adj","pl":"horribles","ipa":"/ɔ.ʁibl/","gl":"horrible (causing horror)","ety":{"chain":[{"l":"fro","f":"horrible","t":"inh"},{"l":"la","f":"horribilis","t":"der","g":"horrible, terrible, dreadful, fearful"}],"text":"Inherited from Old French horrible, orrible, orible, borrowed from Latin horribilis."}},"fr:immonde":{"w":"immonde","p":"adj","pl":"immondes","ipa":"/i.mɔ̃d/","gl":"impure; unclean","ety":{"chain":[{"l":"la","f":"immundus","t":"der","g":"unclean"}],"text":"From Latin immundus (“unclean”). Compare